  "releaseNotes": "Support Async<'Testable> & Task<'Testable>. Slight behavior change: an explicit upcast to non-generic `Task` (`:> Task`) is now needed for tests involving `Task<'T>` where `'T` is not itself a testable type. (by Brian Rourke Boll)",
